# SYNTHETIC FISPACT-II-style inventory print with the CLEAR (clearance index) column.
# Authored for nucleide in the real FISPACT-II wide-table grammar (HAZARDS + CLEAR
# keywords); layout cross-checked against the fispact/workshops reference outputs
# (Apache-2.0, 2020/exercises/files/basic/compressxs/ref/inventorywithcompress_ref.out)
# but all numbers below are synthetic hand-picked round values, not copied output.
#
# Grammar mirrored (FISPACT-II main output inventory section, CLEAR keyword on):
#   TIME INTERVAL header: `1 * * * TIME INTERVAL <n> * * * ... TIME IS <v> SECS ...`
#     (irradiation) or `... COOLING TIME IS <v> SECS OR ...` (cooling steps).
#   Two-line column header: `NUCLIDE ATOMS GRAMS Bq b-Energy a-Energy g-Energy
#     DOSE RATE INGESTION INHALATION CLEARANCE Bq/A2 HALF LIFE` + units row.
#   Data rows: `<sym> <mass>[<isomer>] [<flags>] <11 floats> <half-life|Stable>`.
#   Flags (NB legend): `#` stable, `>` present before irradiation, `&` gamma
#     spectrum approximately calculated, `?` convergence not reached.
#   Table closes at `0 TOTAL NUMBER OF NUCLIDES PRINTED IN INVENTORY = ...`.
1 * * * TIME INTERVAL   1 * * * * * * * TIME IS   0.0000E+00 SECS * * * ELAPSED TIME IS   0.000ps   * * * FLUX AMP IS  1.1000E+14 /cm^2/s * * * * * * * * * * * * * *
  NUCLIDE        ATOMS         GRAMS        Bq       b-Energy    a-Energy   g-Energy    DOSE RATE   INGESTION  INHALATION   CLEARANCE     Bq/A2     HALF LIFE
                                                        kW          kW         kW         Sv/hr      DOSE(Sv)    DOSE(Sv)     INDEX       Ratio      seconds

  V  55     > 2.00000E+20   1.000E-01   0.000E+00   0.000E+00   0.00E+00   0.000E+00   0.000E+00   0.000E+00   0.000E+00   0.000E+00   0.000E+00     Stable
  Fe 56    #> 1.00000E+20   1.000E-01   0.000E+00   0.000E+00   0.00E+00   0.000E+00   0.000E+00   0.000E+00   0.000E+00   0.000E+00   0.000E+00     Stable
  Co 60     > 1.00000E+15   1.000E-07   4.000E+06   1.000E-06   0.00E+00   2.000E-06   1.000E+00   1.000E+00   1.000E+00   1.000E+06   1.000E+00   1.6636E+08
  Rb 86m  &  2.00000E+10   2.000E-12   8.000E+09   4.000E-06   0.00E+00   8.000E-06   2.000E+00   2.000E+00   2.000E+00   4.000E+09   2.000E+00   6.100E+01
