   TOTAL ACTIVITY EXCLUDING TRITIUM     1.20001E+10 Bq
0  INGESTION  HAZARD FOR ALL MATERIALS  3.00000E+00 Sv/kg
   INHALATION HAZARD FOR ALL MATERIALS  3.00000E+00 Sv/kg
                                   | NB: IN FOLLOWING TABLES                     |
                                   |                         ? MEANS CONVERGENCE NOT REACHED FOR NUCLIDE         |
                                   -------------------------------------------------------------------------------
                                   V                                                                             V
1 * * * TIME INTERVAL   2 * * * * * * * COOLING TIME IS   8.6400E+04 SECS OR  1.0000E+00 DAYS  * * * ELAPSED TIME IS   1.040 d   * * * FLUX AMP IS  0.0000E+00 /cm^2/s * * *
  NUCLIDE        ATOMS         GRAMS        Bq       b-Energy    a-Energy   g-Energy    DOSE RATE   INGESTION  INHALATION   CLEARANCE     Bq/A2     HALF LIFE
                                                        kW          kW         kW         Sv/hr      DOSE(Sv)    DOSE(Sv)     INDEX       Ratio      seconds

